AA-860 (Backlog, Medium, project "Data Platform — Schema, Ops & Scale", 0 comments): split the CIS runtime. Today api, worker and migrations all connect as aa_cis_admin, which owns every CIS object and is a member of rds_superuser. Target: cis_owner (NOLOGIN) owns the CIS objects and cis_app runs the api and worker. Scope from the issue:
